    Returns = [0.02, -0.0098039, 0.0396039]  
    Mean = 0.0166  
    Variance = ((0.02–0.0166)² + (–0.0098039–0.0166)² + (0.0396039–0.0166)²) / 3 ≈ 0.000405  
    Volatility (%) = sqrt(0.000405) × 100 ≈ 2.01  
  Output: 2.01  

